{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45472","headline":"山居八咏 七 · 常达","name":"山居八咏 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡僧论的旨，物物唱圆成。\n疎柳春来翠，幽窗日渐明。\n禅心清石室，蝶翅覆花英。\n好听谈玄处，乔松鹤数声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}